<title>CANADA: Canlan to make C$8.8 mln warrant offer.</title>
<headline>Canlan to make C$8.8 mln warrant offer.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canlan Investment Corp said on Tuesday it was offering, by way of private placement, up to 2,348,000 special warrants at C$3.75 each.</p>
<p>The offer could generate up to C$8.805 million.</p>
<p>Canlan said each special warrant entitles the holder to receive one common share of Canlan without any additional payment.</p>
<p>Financing is expected to close by January 8, 1997, Canlan said.</p>
<p>Canlan common shares were trading at C$3.75 in early afternoon activity on the Toronto Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
